      <cyrillic>намилзах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>NAMULZA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= nammulza-, namnalza-, nambulza-] v.i. To be agitated; to tremble, shake; to move up and down.</definition>
      <page>563</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠣᠳᠤᠨ ᠱᠠᠯᠠ ᠨᠠᠮᠣᠯᠵᠠᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>modun šala --mui</transcript>
          <definition> The wooden floor is shaking.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
